{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "name": "GStepper",
  "tag": "g-stepper",
  "status": "draft",
  "since": "0.1.0",
  "description": "Indicador de avance por pasos discretos: horizontal y vertical, indicadores de número, punto, icono, segmento y línea, estados (hecho, actual, pendiente, error, advertencia, bloqueado, opcional), navegación opcional y adaptación por el ancho del contenedor (compacto «Paso N de M»).",
  "contract": "design/contracts/stepper.md",
  "prototype": "design/lab/stepper/r01/",
  "style": "packages/vue/src/components/GStepper/GStepper.css",
  "props": [
    {
      "name": "steps",
      "type": "Array",
      "default": []
    },
    {
      "name": "modelValue",
      "type": "String | Number",
      "default": null
    },
    {
      "name": "orientation",
      "type": "String",
      "default": "horizontal",
      "values": [
        "horizontal",
        "vertical"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "indicator",
      "type": "String",
      "default": "number",
      "values": [
        "number",
        "dot",
        "icon",
        "segment",
        "line"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "navigation",
      "type": "String",
      "default": "none",
      "values": [
        "none",
        "back",
        "free"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "responsive",
      "type": "String",
      "default": "auto",
      "values": [
        "auto",
        "never",
        "compact"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "color",
      "type": "String",
      "default": "brand",
      "values": [
        "brand",
        "accent",
        "neutral",
        "success",
        "warning",
        "danger",
        "info"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "size",
      "type": "String",
      "default": "md",
      "values": [
        "sm",
        "md",
        "lg"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "density",
      "type": "String",
      "default": "default",
      "values": [
        "default",
        "comfortable",
        "compact"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "disabled",
      "type": "Boolean",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "name": "expandAll",
      "type": "Boolean",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "name": "labels",
      "type": "Object",
      "default": {}
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "field": "id",
      "type": "String | Number",
      "note": "Opcional; si falta, el índice"
    },
    {
      "field": "label",
      "type": "String",
      "note": "Obligatorio; nombre accesible del paso"
    },
    {
      "field": "description",
      "type": "String"
    },
    {
      "field": "status",
      "type": "String",
      "values": [
        "error",
        "warning"
      ]
    },
    {
      "field": "optional",
      "type": "Boolean"
    },
    {
      "field": "disabled",
      "type": "Boolean",
      "note": "Bloqueado: nunca es botón"
    }
  ],
  "labels": [
    "complete",
    "current",
    "pending",
    "error",
    "warning",
    "disabled",
    "optional",
    "progress",
    "showAll",
    "hideAll"
  ],
  "events": [
    {
      "name": "update:modelValue",
      "payload": "id del paso",
      "trigger": "El usuario activa un paso navegable y nadie impidió select"
    },
    {
      "name": "select",
      "payload": "{ id, index, preventDefault() }",
      "trigger": "El usuario activa un paso navegable. Cancelable"
    }
  ],
  "slots": [
    {
      "name": "content",
      "purpose": "Contenido asociado a un paso (solo vertical). Alcance: { step, index, state }"
    },
    {
      "name": "icon",
      "purpose": "Icono del paso con indicator=\"icon\" (Lucide, decorativo). Alcance: { step, index, state }"
    },
    {
      "name": "label",
      "purpose": "Etiqueta con contenido rico. Alcance: { step, index, state }"
    },
    {
      "name": "description",
      "purpose": "Descripción con contenido rico. Alcance: { step, index, state }"
    }
  ],
  "tokens": [
    "--g-color-primary[-strong|-soft|-text]",
    "--g-color-on-primary",
    "--g-color-{accent|neutral|success|warning|danger|info}[-strong|-soft|-text]",
    "--g-color-on-{accent|neutral|success|warning|danger|info}",
    "--g-color-text",
    "--g-color-text-muted",
    "--g-color-text-subtle",
    "--g-color-border",
    "--g-color-border-control",
    "--g-color-surface",
    "--g-color-surface-sunken",
    "--g-color-focus",
    "--g-radius-pill",
    "--g-radius-xs",
    "--g-space-1..4",
    "--g-font-ui",
    "--g-text-{caption|body-sm|body}-{size|line}",
    "--g-text-caption-weight",
    "--g-text-title-weight",
    "--g-text-action-weight",
    "--g-border-width",
    "--g-focus-width",
    "--g-focus-offset",
    "--g-duration-fast",
    "--g-duration-press",
    "--g-ease-standard",
    "--g-ease-out",
    "--g-press-scale"
  ],
  "states": [
    "complete",
    "current",
    "pending",
    "error",
    "warning",
    "disabled",
    "optional",
    "focus-visible",
    "hover",
    "navigable",
    "compact",
    "condensed"
  ],
  "pending": [
    "Auditoría de coco sobre el componente real con un tema distinto al por defecto (paso 5)",
    "README (mora-docs)",
    "Lector de pantalla real: lista, aria-current y texto de estado",
    "Medición por contenedor en un navegador real (las pruebas de jsdom la simulan)",
    "RTL, forced-colors real, táctil real y zoom al 200%",
    "Sin scroll horizontal ni condensar pasos completados en v0.1"
  ]
}
